@startuml
title ShikigamiApp データフロー

left to right direction

actor "ユーザー" as User

rectangle "Gui" as Gui
rectangle "Gateway" as Gateway
rectangle "Core" as Core
rectangle "SaveData" as SaveData

artifact "ShikigamiData.csv" as ShikigamiCsv

folder "保存データ" as SaveFiles {
   artifact "*.build.json" as BuildJson
   artifact "*.mitama.json" as MitamaJson
   artifact "*.snapshot.json" as SnapshotJson
}

User <--> Gui : 入力 / 表示

Gui <--> Gateway : DTO / Outcome\n計算・比較・式神操作
Gateway <--> Core : Native Model\n処理要求・結果

Core <--> ShikigamiCsv : 式神データ\n読込・更新

Gui <--> SaveData : 保存データ\n読込・保存

SaveData <--> BuildJson
SaveData <--> MitamaJson
SaveData <--> SnapshotJson

@enduml
